  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Non-Revenue Water Fund for Municipal Infrastructure</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The National Business Initiative (NBF) has launched the Non-Revenue Water Fund, with a target of raising R100 million in seed grant funding to support municipal programmes focused on reducing Non-Revenue Water (NRW) and improving water management across South Africa. The UK Foreign, Commonwealth &amp; Development Office (FCDO)&#x2019;s contribution will play a pivotal role in bridging a critical financing gap, enabling the implementation of large-scale water demand management interventions. This funding will also help scale a replicable model that promotes sustainable water use, enhances service delivery, and generates employment opportunities in the country&#x2019;s most vulnerable communities.</narrative>
  </description>
